{%- comment -%}
  "Real People. Real Results." video carousel: a heading, a short line, and a row of tall video thumbnails. Tap one and it plays right in the card (tap again to pause, small button to switch sound on or off). Swipe or drag the row, or use the two arrows and the dots below it. When all the videos fit on the screen they just sit centred and the arrows and dots are not needed.
  EDIT YOUR VIDEOS BELOW. One video = video link ||| picture link ||| short description. Put @@ on its own line between videos.
  The video link can be an MP4 file, a YouTube link or a Vimeo link. The picture is the cover shown before the video plays (tall, 9 by 16 is best).
  The links start as Metabolae's own files so the section is an exact copy straight away.
  Before you go live, upload your own videos (as MP4) and pictures to your store (Content > Files) and paste your links here instead, so they keep working and are yours.
  mb_heading = the big line (you can put <em>words</em> in it to colour them with mb_accent). mb_sub = the small line under it (can contain <strong>bold</strong>).
  mb_accent = the play button, the current dot and the arrow hover colour (Metabolae's orange; use #943434 for your red). mb_heading_color = the big line. mb_sub_color = the small line. mb_bg = section background.
  These colours are locked, so the theme cannot turn them black.
  Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead. Do not type three | in a row except as the separators.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_heading = 'Real People.  Real Results.' -%}
{%- assign mb_sub = 'Hear it in their own words.' -%}
{%- assign mb_accent = '#b85c2a' -%}
{%- assign mb_heading_color = '#1a1a1a' -%}
{%- assign mb_sub_color = '#000000' -%}
{%- assign mb_bg = '#ffffff' -%}
